~ progress

Uncle Rowan: You've come farther than any of us ever imagined.

Uncle Rowan: When you first returned to Harvestia...

Uncle Rowan: The fields were empty.

Uncle Rowan: The forests were overgrown.

Uncle Rowan: The barns stood silent.

Uncle Rowan: But you never gave up.

Uncle Rowan: Because of you...

Uncle Rowan: The crops are growing again.

Uncle Rowan: The chickens have found a new caretaker.

Uncle Rowan: The cows once again fill the barns with life.

Uncle Rowan: Harvestia is alive again.

Uncle Rowan: But...

Uncle Rowan: There is still one promise we have yet to fulfill.

Uncle Rowan: Your grandfather always dreamed of seeing his home filled with laughter again.

Uncle Rowan: The villagers have decided to rebuild it.

Uncle Rowan: We only need one final contribution from you.

Uncle Rowan: Bring me everything Harvestia can now provide.

Uncle Rowan: Crops, animal products, building materials...

Uncle Rowan: Together, we'll build your home.

=> END


~ turn_in

Uncle Rowan: Welcome back.

Uncle Rowan: Let's see if you've gathered everything we need.

do GameDialogueManager.action_open_homecoming_board()

=> END


~ after_donation

Uncle Rowan: ...

Uncle Rowan: This is more than enough.

Uncle Rowan: Every piece of wood...

Uncle Rowan: Every stone...

Uncle Rowan: Every crop...

Uncle Rowan: They all carry the hope you've brought back to Harvestia.

Uncle Rowan: Leave the rest to us.

Uncle Rowan: We'll make sure your grandfather's home stands proudly once again.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

do GameDialogueManager.action_start_homecoming_ceremony()

=> END


~ completed

Uncle Rowan: Everything is ready.

Uncle Rowan: The villagers are waiting for you.

Uncle Rowan: Come with me.

do GameDialogueManager.action_rowan_lead_player()

=> END

~ final_ending

Uncle Rowan: Your grandfather would be proud.

Uncle Rowan: You brought Harvestia back to life.

Uncle Rowan: And now... this home belongs to you.

do GameDialogueManager.action_rowan_lead_player()

=> END